{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/dd1153a3ca72c8951f0a82edbe783b74.avif?t=1757279804\" width=790 height=64 /></span>Long before kings claimed crowns, before men carved kingdoms from wilderness, a secret cult worshiped an ancient entity known only as <i>The Veiled One</i>. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.poster.avif?t=1757279804\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.webm?t=1757279804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.mp4?t=1757279804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>They built this crypt as both temple and prison. Legends say a ritual went wrong: instead of summoning the entity, they trapped it here, sealed beneath stone and sigil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9eedf836cf248591fd176ea105bb7ea0.poster.avif?t=1757279804\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9eedf836cf248591fd176ea105bb7ea0.webm?t=1757279804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9eedf836cf248591fd176ea105bb7ea0.mp4?t=1757279804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, the crypt faded into obscurity, whispered only in fragments:<br>\u00a0<br><i>\u201cA treasure greater than any king\u2019s ransom lies within.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cNo soul returns once the silence begins to whisper.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe stones themselves hunger.\u201d</i><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b0c85da87d47b44dbebf640fa87912fd.poster.avif?t=1757279804\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b0c85da87d47b44dbebf640fa87912fd.webm?t=1757279804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b0c85da87d47b44dbebf640fa87912fd.mp4?t=1757279804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Edge of Evil</strong> is a horror experience that will take you deep below, through dark twisted passages and into the depths of a long forgotten locked crypt in search of answers to an ancient seal that has been broken, unleashing a powerful presence from the mysterious <strong><i>&quot;Black World&quot;</i></strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<br> <br>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/bee0fe02a5d5c8227c5bfe9d15469152.poster.avif?t=1757279804\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/bee0fe02a5d5c8227c5bfe9d15469152.webm?t=1757279804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/bee0fe02a5d5c8227c5bfe9d15469152.mp4?t=1757279804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong>    <br><strong> </strong>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b959e7ebaa5d1c4bc73e17650dc6008f.avif?t=1757279804\" width=512 height=64 /></span><strong>A Truly</strong>\u00a0<strong>Haunting Experience:</strong> Realistic graphics and immersive sounds as well as a minimal user interface ensure a totally visceral horror experience; forcing you to continuously question your own senses... just beyond, and right up to the <strong><i>edge.</i></strong>..<br><br><br>- Realistic Graphics      <br>- Immersive Sound And Music      <br>- Eerie Ambience And Atmosphere      <br>- Intriguing Puzzles And Traps      <br>- Interesting Characters<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0217d9ec3f58cb313c702a6cef0a440a.poster.avif?t=1757279804\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0217d9ec3f58cb313c702a6cef0a440a.webm?t=1757279804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <br>Does digging up graves sound like fun?  You would be surprised what you can find buried in this crypt... treasure, secret passages and a dark hidden past. But don't dig too deep or you might uncover something that probably should stay buried. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/1119e401c45778d40f34e987da50194a.avif?t=1757279804\" width=1400 height=800 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/f18408b0e956cf1be386528de696b6eb.avif?t=1757279804\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928510?t=1757279804","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928510?t=1757279804","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/dc4ea41a4d7df27fa0b2062a3fac040148ba5033/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757279804","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/dc4ea41a4d7df27fa0b2062a3fac040148ba5033/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757279804","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/dd1153a3ca72c8951f0a82edbe783b74.avif?t=1757279804\" width=790 height=64 /></span>Long before kings claimed crowns, before men carved kingdoms from wilderness, a secret cult worshiped an ancient entity known only as <i>The Veiled One</i>. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.poster.avif?t=1757279804\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.webm?t=1757279804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.mp4?t=1757279804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>They built this crypt as both temple and prison. Legends say a ritual went wrong: instead of summoning the entity, they trapped it here, sealed beneath stone and sigil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap